 {"beat": 220, "text": "Disorder is the only solution."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Let loose, forget all conventions,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "And together, let\u2019s live without pretensions!"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}